{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>相片越拍越多，儲存空間卻越來越緊張。Shrinkr 專為相片圖庫爆滿的 iPhone 用家而設，能一次過找出最佔空間的相片並批次壓縮，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>批次壓縮相片保留原貌</h2>\n<p>Shrinkr 會掃描整個相片圖庫，顯示可回收的空間，再一鍵批次壓縮。原相片會移至「最近刪除」，30 日內仍可還原，並由外觀相同的小型副本補上。喜好項目不受影響，Live Photos 保留動態與聲音，相簿與日期資料一併保留。用家可調整壓縮幅度、預覽節省空間，並排除僅存於 iCloud 的相片以免耗用流動數據。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Shrinkr: Photo Storage Saver</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T00:18:05.428118+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}